  "translations": {
    "translations": [
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "FR",
        "iso_639_1": "fr",
        "name": "Français",
        "english_name": "French",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.arte.tv/fr/videos/126184-000-A/chine-russie-inde-et-co-nouveaux-maitres-du-monde/",
          "overview": "Depuis près de vingt ans, autour de la Chine, de la Russie et de l'Inde, les BRICS+ se structurent en un club de puissances émergentes qui rassemble aujourd'hui plus de la moitié de la population mondiale. Banque commune, médias, exercices militaires, contestation du dollar : du sommet de Rio en 2025 aux grandes parades de Pékin, ce documentaire retrace l'ascension de cette alliance hétéroclite qui entend bâtir un ordre mondial « post-occidental », face à un bloc occidental de plus en plus divisé.",
          "runtime": 91,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": ""
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "DE",
        "iso_639_1": "de",
        "name": "Deutsch",
        "english_name": "German",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://www.arte.tv/de/videos/126184-000-A/china-russland-indien-co-eine-neue-weltordnung/",
          "overview": "Während das westliche Bündnis schwächelt, formiert sich unter autoritärer Führung eine Gegenallianz. Die ersten fünf BRICS-Staaten – mit über der Hälfte der Weltbevölkerung und 40 Prozent der globalen Wirtschaftsleistung – bauen eigene Strukturen auf: Banken, Medien, Militärübungen. Ihr Ziel: ein neues Bündnis – das den Dollar herausfordert und eine neue Weltordnung will. (Text: Arte)",
          "runtime": 91,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "China, Russland, Indien & Co. - Eine neue Weltordnung?"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "US",
        "iso_639_1": "en",
        "name": "English",
        "english_name": "English",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "https://c21media.net/marketplace/studiofactrights/brics-the-worlds-new-masterminds/23494/",
          "overview": "The BRICS countries now represent half of the world's population and 40% of GDP. Seen by some as an anti-Western coalition and by others as an economic counterweight, the BRICS are gaining momentum in their desire to impose a new world order. For now, they are maneuvering to \"de-dollarize\" the global economy and rally as many countries in the \"global South\" as possible to their model. Tomorrow, will they succeed in supplanting Western institutions and values with their parallel organizations, or will Europe manage to rebalance the playing field?",
          "runtime": 90,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "BRICS, the Worlds New Masterminds?"
        }
      },
      {
        "iso_3166_1": "LV",
        "iso_639_1": "lv",
        "name": "Latviešu",
        "english_name": "Latvian",
        "data": {
          "homepage": "",
          "overview": "Mūsdienās BRICS valstis pārstāv pusi pasaules iedzīvotāju un veido 40 % no pasaules IKP. Vieni tās uzskata par koalīciju, kas vērsta pret Rietumiem, citi – par ekonomisku pretspēku. BRICS valstis nostiprina savu ietekmi, tiecoties izveidot jaunu pasaules kārtību. Pašlaik tās cenšas mazināt ASV dolāra lomu pasaules ekonomikā un piesaistīt savam modelim pēc iespējas vairāk tā dēvēto Globālo Dienvidu valstu. Vai nākotnē tām būs pa spēkam aizstāt Rietumu institūcijas un vērtības ar savām paralēlajām organizācijām vai arī Eiropai izdosies atjaunot spēku līdzsvaru?",
          "runtime": 0,
          "tagline": "",
          "title": "BRICS. Ceļā uz jaunu pasaules kārtību"
        }
      }
    ]
